description	"War Refugee

Displaced citizens of the galaxy, forced into the fray. They aren't soldiers, but they are survivors.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- 15% Faster Movement
- Old Blaster Pistol (1)
-- Mag Reload
- Cheap Blaster Rifle (1)
-- CR2, 15% Slower Rof, 10% Less Damage/FP Drain
-- Mag Reload, 15% Slower Movement
- Vibro-Knife
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Cripples/Low Damage
- EMP Grenade (1)
-- Pulse Grenade, Disarms, Low Damage

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (4)
- Assemble (3)
- Healing (1)
- Stamina (1)
- Dexterity (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4]
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS2]
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"
